    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>DEMO IS NOW AVAILABLE!!!</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try out Service Dog for free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547510/extras/4374f9996126f06ffdfcdfe64afd8ede.avif?t=1744434741\" width=462 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Every Dog Loves a Good Walk...</u>\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when that leash snaps, and your master eats pavement, that sweet taste of freedom is undeniable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547510/extras/7fd8f609a8f3b35923cdc1720726f5ce.avif?t=1744434741\" width=462 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>He's Right Behind you!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your master is hot on your tail, but you've got way more important things to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547510/extras/8fb1fb175568639b127e0ada32e8d0d1.avif?t=1744434741\" width=462 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Everyone has a Favor to Ask.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you help? Who will you knock over? And who will get peed on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547510/extras/e0d5a4f67879b92ec9c991b87df18fe7.avif?t=1744434741\" width=462 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Good ol' Arcade Action!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't make a Service Dog without breaking a few eggs... and a few tables... and a few fire hydrants...  you get the picture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547510/extras/c044e2b3e20486696582ee3f35c30cc9.avif?t=1744434741\" width=462 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Or maybe, you save the world by destroying it, </u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wouldn't that be neat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of objects &amp; characters to knock over</strong> \u2013 If it stands, it falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four massive open zones</strong> \u2013 Explore sprawling environments packed with collectables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 30 fully voiced quests</strong> \u2013 Help out a questionable cast of bizarre NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant pursuit</strong> \u2013 Outrun your devoted Master before you get leashed again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; power-ups</strong> \u2013 Because sometimes, a dog needs more than just teeth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic music </strong>\u2013 From bouncing melodies to rebellious power chords!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong> \u2013 Suit up for maximum mayhem!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom modes</strong> \u2013 You control the destruction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An epic main story</strong> \u2013 Pursue Greatness, Protect Breakfast, and prove you\u2019re the <strong>Ultimate Service Dog!</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>DEMO IS NOW AVAILABLE!!!</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try out Service Dog for free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547510/extras/4374f9996126f06ffdfcdfe64afd8ede.avif?t=1744434741\" width=462 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Every Dog Loves a Good Walk...</u>\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when that leash snaps, and your master eats pavement, that sweet taste of freedom is undeniable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547510/extras/7fd8f609a8f3b35923cdc1720726f5ce.avif?t=1744434741\" width=462 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>He's Right Behind you!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your master is hot on your tail, but you've got way more important things to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547510/extras/8fb1fb175568639b127e0ada32e8d0d1.avif?t=1744434741\" width=462 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Everyone has a Favor to Ask.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will you help? Who will you knock over? And who will get peed on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547510/extras/e0d5a4f67879b92ec9c991b87df18fe7.avif?t=1744434741\" width=462 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Good ol' Arcade Action!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't make a Service Dog without breaking a few eggs... and a few tables... and a few fire hydrants...  you get the picture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547510/extras/c044e2b3e20486696582ee3f35c30cc9.avif?t=1744434741\" width=462 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Or maybe, you save the world by destroying it, </u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wouldn't that be neat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of objects &amp; characters to knock over</strong> \u2013 If it stands, it falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four massive open zones</strong> \u2013 Explore sprawling environments packed with collectables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 30 fully voiced quests</strong> \u2013 Help out a questionable cast of bizarre NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant pursuit</strong> \u2013 Outrun your devoted Master before you get leashed again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; power-ups</strong> \u2013 Because sometimes, a dog needs more than just teeth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic music </strong>\u2013 From bouncing melodies to rebellious power chords!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong> \u2013 Suit up for maximum mayhem!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom modes</strong> \u2013 You control the destruction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An epic main story</strong> \u2013 Pursue Greatness, Protect Breakfast, and prove you\u2019re the <strong>Ultimate Service Dog!</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Unleash the chaos! Smash, bash, and crash through everything\u2014and everyone\u2014in sight. From wrecking houses to sabotaging dance-offs, Everyone has a favor to ask. Is he a good boy or a public menace? One thing\u2019s for sure\u2014this is Service Dog",
